        "content": "# Conflict of Interest Detection Workflow  \n\n## How it works:  \n\nThis workflow automatically identifies potential conflicts of interest by comparing employee records with supplier ownership details and transaction activity. It evaluates direct matches such as names, emails, and phone numbers, along with indirect signals like shared addresses, last names, and unusual transaction patterns to detect hidden relationships. A scoring-based logic determines the risk level of each case. AI then generates a clear and professional explanation to support compliance review. High-risk conflicts trigger Slack alerts for immediate attention, while all detected cases are logged in Google Sheets for tracking and audit purposes. This helps organizations proactively detect risks, ensure transparency, and strengthen procurement governance.  \n\n## Setup Steps:  \n\n1. Scheduled Trigger  \nRun workflow weekly.  \n\n2. Data Collection  \nFetch employee and supplier data from Google Sheets.  \n\n3. Relationship Analysis  \nCompare records and calculate conflict risk score.  \n\n4. AI Insights  \nGenerate explanation and compliance summary.  \n\n5. Decision Logic  \nIdentify high-risk conflicts using IF node.  \n\n6. Action & Storage  \nSend Slack alerts and store all cases in Google Sheets.  "
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
